        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sbs_item",
          "label": "Shop by Style item",
          "info": "Optional, and only used by the \"Shop by style\" layout. Leave it empty and this card simply takes the next unused item from the menu, so a new section needs no setup. Fill it in with a child item's exact title or handle to pin this card to that style, and the card then keeps its title, link and image wherever you drag the block. The block's own Title field works as a pin too. Leave blank on Explore Our Range blocks."
        },
